WEBVTT

00:00:00.820 --> 00:00:01.640
Hey...

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:02.730
Hey!

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:05.230
Misha! What's wrong?!

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:11.240
Rhodes Island will always welcome you, Misha.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:13.400
Finally...

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:15.610
Misha...

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:36.050
Heave-ho.

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:41.840
Oh, thank heavens. You're awake.

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:42.480
Huh?

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:44.810
Are you okay, Misha?

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:49.480
I heard about you from Skullshatterer.

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:51.730
It's nice to meet you.

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:57.710
Ivan, come help the patrol.

00:00:57.710 --> 00:00:58.700
Gotcha.

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:00.620
Okay, see ya.

00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:07.670
Looks like your flare-up has passed.

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:10.670
Who are you?

00:01:24.590 --> 00:01:27.190
You're alive... You're still alive...

00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:29.050
Alex...

00:01:28.090 --> 00:01:29.050
No.

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:32.220
The man who went by that name is dead.

00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:34.740
Now, I am...

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:36.790
Skullshatterer.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:11.830
Hoshiguma.

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:14.220
Next one.

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:20.000
Jeez. Where are all these guys coming from?

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:23.290
Amiya, these aren't the 
Reunion forces we're looking for.

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:24.550
I see.

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:27.160
<i>We'll expand our search area.</i>

00:03:27.160 --> 00:03:28.460
Thank you.

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:32.730
Misha...

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:40.490
Where are we going?

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:43.490
Training. I want you to come with me.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:50.270
Why? Why did you join Reunion?

00:03:51.270 --> 00:03:54.140
It was Reunion who 
wreaked havoc on Chernobog.

00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:56.250
And now, they're doing the same in Lungmen.

00:03:56.800 --> 00:04:00.490
You're sacrificing children and innocents.

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:01.510
It's wrong!

00:04:02.350 --> 00:04:03.410
Sacrificing?

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:08.460
Do you know how many 
Infected have been sacrificed?

00:04:08.460 --> 00:04:10.000
Even so...

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.900
An eye for an eye. It's only natural.

00:04:13.650 --> 00:04:18.520
But you're even sacrificing people whose 
only "crime" is not doing what Reunion says!

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:21.030
Reunion is enlightened.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:22.220
What?

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:30.040
We fight for the freedom of the Infected.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:34.730
If you choose to avoid the 
fighting and not join Reunion,

00:04:34.730 --> 00:04:36.820
I won't say that's the wrong decision.

00:04:36.820 --> 00:04:43.330
But I've already decided to fight this 
cruel world alongside the rest of Reunion.

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:48.480
Do you really believe anyone is innocent?

00:04:50.730 --> 00:04:53.560
Nobody treats the Infected as human.

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:56.560
The government doesn't. Nor the people.

00:04:57.250 --> 00:04:58.700
Are the people not accomplices?

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.520
Ever since I became an Infected,

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:06.070
they've treated me like 
vermin to be exterminated.

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:08.320
You saw that for yourself.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:12.470
That day, even though 
I was still a kid, Father...

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:15.830
and those men from the 
government took me away.

00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:20.340
It was a cold, snowy day. 
I tried my hardest to fight back.

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:24.050
Mother tried to protect me
 and gave chase.

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:25.300
But then—

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:26.800
Stop it!

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:30.650
Sorry... I'm so sorry.

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:33.980
I was so scared...

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:40.790
I'm not saying you were to blame.

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:43.890
We were still kids back then.

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:47.700
There was nothing we could've done.

00:05:48.150 --> 00:05:49.430
It's just how things were.

00:05:50.390 --> 00:05:52.170
But things are different now.

00:05:52.170 --> 00:05:54.950
Reunion has given me the courage to fight.

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:59.460
For the Infected, Reunion is salvation.

00:06:00.230 --> 00:06:01.560
Salvation...

00:06:04.820 --> 00:06:09.750
But Amiya... Rhodes Island helped me.

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:11.720
Did you say Rhodes Island?

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:15.560
Don't be fooled! Rhodes Island 
may claim they help the Infected,

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:18.480
but they're just traitors 
and servants of the powerful!

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:22.500
Do you know how many of our 
comrades Rhodes Island has hurt?!

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:27.090
In the end, all they 
care about is getting rid of us!

00:06:27.090 --> 00:06:30.200
But Rhodes Island didn't kill anyone!

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:32.950
They may have fought, 
but they never took a life!

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:39.210
Listen! Rhodes Island's ways
 won't change anything.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:41.710
But Reunion's will!

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:45.710
These lands! Everything across the world! 
We can completely change <i>everything</i>!

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:49.220
Reunion has that power!

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:52.470
Join me, Misha!

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:55.970
And let me protect you.

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:58.980
Skullshatterer...

00:07:02.780 --> 00:07:05.140
So this is their hideout, huh?

00:07:05.140 --> 00:07:08.340
Looks like there's a lot of them.

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:13.460
Not a bad spot for a base. No one 
would dare go near an Originium quarry.

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:14.070
What the...

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:16.030
What's wrong?

00:07:17.140 --> 00:07:19.370
Hey, you're leaning out too far.

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:20.290
There she is.

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:21.110
Hm?

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:23.680
It's Misha! No doubt about it!

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:24.920
Calm down.

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:26.760
We need to tell Amiya.

00:07:27.370 --> 00:07:28.130
Exusiai.

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:30.130
They're coming this way.

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:32.910
Huh? Wait, is that my fault?

00:07:32.910 --> 00:07:34.070
'Fraid so.

00:07:35.820 --> 00:07:37.040
Did you tell them?

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:38.400
Yep! All in apple pie order!

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:42.730
Perfect. Let's hold them 
here as long as we can.

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:46.660
Time for a warm-up.

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:49.490
Misha, look.

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:52.680
Turn this all the way to the left,

00:07:53.830 --> 00:07:55.420
and load the cartridge.

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:58.150
Once you're done loading it,

00:07:59.510 --> 00:08:00.590
close it up.

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:03.960
Are you following so far?

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:05.420
Y-Yeah.

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:07.000
Take aim at your target.

00:08:09.530 --> 00:08:10.760
And pull the trigger.

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:23.520
What was that just now?

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:26.520
Arts. There's more to it than just shooting.

00:08:27.320 --> 00:08:30.380
You detonate the shell with Arts.

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:34.540
You can do it, too.

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:41.360
You should learn how to defend yourself.

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:42.350
But...

00:08:50.430 --> 00:08:52.300
Hold the grip tight.

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:54.860
Take aim at your target.

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:57.680
Keep your mind focused.

00:08:58.090 --> 00:08:59.580
Control your breathing.

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:07.190
I feel so warm...

00:09:16.090 --> 00:09:17.890
Don't go overboard.

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:18.780
Huh?

00:09:19.190 --> 00:09:21.450
You say that, but...

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:28.330
Lie still.

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:35.820
So that's Arts?

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:41.000
Awesome! Just perfect!

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:42.390
That's amazing, Misha!

00:09:42.730 --> 00:09:46.310
We have the same power!

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:50.730
Just like before.

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:52.150
Hm? Misha?

00:09:53.970 --> 00:09:56.720
Okay, do it again while 
it's fresh in your mind.

00:09:56.720 --> 00:09:58.000
I will!

00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:59.910
S-Skullshatterer!

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:01.250
Ivan?

00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:05.410
What's wrong?

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:06.970
What happened?

00:10:06.970 --> 00:10:08.370
We need to leave!

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:09.670
They found us!

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:11.040
Rhodes Island is coming!

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:11.920
What?

00:10:12.600 --> 00:10:15.000
Rhodes Island, those bastards!

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:19.020
Everyone, gather up! We will repel them!

00:10:20.280 --> 00:10:23.430
<i>We've found the hideout 
where Reunion took Misha.</i>

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:27.180
<i>It's in an abandoned quarry
in the Lungmen Outskirts.</i>

00:10:27.470 --> 00:10:29.980
All units, head there immediately!

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:33.980
We must save Misha!

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:36.990
Everyone, prepare to storm in!

00:10:57.470 --> 00:10:59.650
Do we have to fight Rhodes Island?

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:03.890
If we talk to them, they'll understand!
 Amiya will definitely—

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.970
Wake up already, Misha!

00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:09.480
Didn't I tell you?! They turned 
their backs on the Infected!

00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:12.920
We've got nothing to say to traitors!

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:13.980
But...

00:11:14.830 --> 00:11:15.830
But...

00:11:16.560 --> 00:11:18.490
We finally found each other again...

00:11:18.950 --> 00:11:20.900
Why don't you understand?

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:26.980
Even if you don't trust Reunion, 
I want you to trust me at least.

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:37.500
Promise...

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:40.510
Promise you'll come back.

00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:41.980
Yeah.

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:44.690
You won't be alone again.

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:48.540
When this battle is over,
 we'll go home together.

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:57.500
Alex...

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:01.530
Hey there.

00:12:03.430 --> 00:12:06.000
You need my help after all, huh?

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:07.550
Unfortunately.

00:12:08.650 --> 00:12:10.550
I appreciate an honest kid.

00:12:10.550 --> 00:12:12.860
The enemy's more of a 
handful than we thought.

00:12:12.860 --> 00:12:15.730
Things aren't really like Talulah said.

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:16.770
My, my...

00:12:17.230 --> 00:12:21.300
So, no matter what happens,
I need you to protect Misha.

00:12:22.110 --> 00:12:23.360
Hmm...

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:25.300
Well, that's easy to say,

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:30.910
but if you guys screw up, 
you realize they'll come for Misha, right?

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:33.250
So we can't screw up.

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:37.400
Sure, but looking at the two forces, 
you don't stand a chance in a fair fight.

00:12:38.930 --> 00:12:40.730
You have a better idea?

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:48.420
You know the one in the hood, 
who's always by the bunny's side?

00:12:48.420 --> 00:12:50.630
The one they call the Doctor?

00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:54.330
That's Rhodes Island's commander, 
the brains of the operation.

00:12:54.930 --> 00:12:59.670
If we take out the brain, 
the whole body falls apart.

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:03.720
Misha will be safe 
if we take out this Doctor?

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:07.600
Sure will. Everything 
will go nice and smooth.

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:10.800
I'll lend you my team for a while.

00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:12.720
You know what you have to do.

00:13:13.470 --> 00:13:14.780
Right?

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:18.480
Yeah. Our target is 
Rhodes Island's commander...

00:13:19.280 --> 00:13:20.200
The Doctor.

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:22.860
This terrain...

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:27.450
The perfect place to lure
your enemy into a trap.

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:32.330
Oh, man. The wind's getting strong.
 Real lousy visibility, too.

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:36.540
It's no problem. This is just a ragtag 
terrorist group, barely holding together.

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:38.420
We'll take them out in a single strike.

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:41.520
Hoshiguma and part of the Special 
Inspection Unit will stand by here.

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:42.890
Don't let anyone through.

00:13:42.890 --> 00:13:43.560
Roger that.

00:13:44.030 --> 00:13:49.020
Don't give them the time to reorganize.
 Whittle down their numbers.

00:13:49.020 --> 00:13:53.770
That said, rescuing Misha
 remains our top priority.

00:13:53.770 --> 00:13:56.950
Monster Inspector, 
she's saying don't go overboard.

00:13:56.950 --> 00:13:58.600
Hmph. I know.

00:13:58.600 --> 00:14:00.410
You, too, Franka.

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:01.720
Okay, okay.

00:14:02.550 --> 00:14:03.150
They're here.

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:20.170
Charge!

00:14:23.930 --> 00:14:24.840
Doctor.

00:14:25.290 --> 00:14:26.130
Let's go!

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:28.970
<i>Mission start.</i>

00:14:29.190 --> 00:14:30.300
Doctor!

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:32.640
Take charge from up top, okay?

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:35.100
Follow them!

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:40.100
Sniper Operators, focus your 
fire on the enemy's front line.

00:14:40.420 --> 00:14:41.540
<i>Break their formation.</i>

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:43.110
Roger that!

00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:44.910
Fall back!

00:14:47.180 --> 00:14:48.820
Casters! Use Arts!

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:52.820
<i>Caster and Sniper Operators, 
continue to interfere with their rearguard.</i>

00:14:52.820 --> 00:14:54.580
<i>Don't give them time to reorganize.</i>

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:56.700
<i>Tear down their front line.</i>

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:05.050
<i>Texas, enemy Arts incoming, 10 o'clock.</i>

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:12.340
My, there's quite a lot of them.

00:15:12.960 --> 00:15:15.310
Liskarm, I'll leave it to you.

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:16.430
You don't have to tell me.

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:25.210
Liskarm!

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:31.110
Sorry for the wait.

00:15:31.520 --> 00:15:33.100
Let's hurry.

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:39.870
Skullshatterer.

00:15:43.140 --> 00:15:45.180
Nice view, huh?

00:15:45.800 --> 00:15:49.380
Relax. We won't get dragged 
into that mess up here.

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:50.840
Well, probably not.

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:54.190
I've got stuff to do, so I'm gonna split.

00:15:54.190 --> 00:15:57.060
If you need anything, 
give me a call on that.

00:15:57.060 --> 00:15:58.140
See ya.

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:05.540
Don't bunch up! Spread out!

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:08.030
Kill the L.G.D.!

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:09.280
Kill them!

00:16:16.320 --> 00:16:19.740
If you raise your sword against me,
 I won't go easy on you.

00:16:20.440 --> 00:16:22.500
Looks like everything's going fine.

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:26.230
<i>All Operators, continue to advance 
toward the enemy stronghold.</i>

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:27.210
On it.

00:16:27.510 --> 00:16:31.540
Come on. Let's go get those
 annoying mad bombers.

00:16:31.540 --> 00:16:34.300
Rescuing Misha is our 
top priority, remember?

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:36.010
Yeah, I know.

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:37.990
Liskarm, behind you!

00:16:40.510 --> 00:16:41.430
So heavy!

00:16:49.630 --> 00:16:50.690
Damn you.

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:05.870
Thanks.

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:07.920
Leave the Casters to me.

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:11.670
Take Exusiai and mop up 
the enemies around us!

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:14.170
The main force... But...

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:15.220
Relax!

00:17:15.520 --> 00:17:17.840
The enemy's numbers are dwindling!

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:20.010
We still have the advantage here!

00:17:20.570 --> 00:17:22.220
Keep up the pressure!

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:25.940
Everyone! We've almost overcome the enemy!

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:29.930
This time, we will save Misha!

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:36.740
<i>Warning: Heat source approaching.</i>

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:41.700
Huh?

00:17:45.650 --> 00:17:46.540
Doctor!

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:48.930
Impossible! They were just...

00:17:49.770 --> 00:17:52.630
Wowee, that actually went pretty well.

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:05.350
Got you!

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:08.290
What?

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:13.480
You don't have what it takes
 to pierce my Hannya!

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:16.280
Don't get in the way!

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:37.300
It was foolish of you to charge 
into the enemy's back line alone.

00:18:52.800 --> 00:18:54.230
I'll...

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:56.030
blow you all up!

00:18:57.260 --> 00:18:58.710
Subdue him!

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:01.310
Doctor! Let me help you up.

00:19:01.310 --> 00:19:01.990
Run.

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:03.400
Hurry!

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:08.560
That heat...

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:11.100
He's going to blow himself up!

00:19:11.100 --> 00:19:12.210
Doctor!

00:19:13.440 --> 00:19:15.820
<i>I'm sorry, Misha.</i>

00:19:16.640 --> 00:19:19.470
<i>I can't... keep our promise.</i>

00:19:22.810 --> 00:19:23.470
<i>No...</i>

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:25.470
<i>You can't...</i>

00:19:25.470 --> 00:19:27.090
Die!

00:19:27.090 --> 00:19:27.850
<i>Not the Doctor...</i>

00:19:29.360 --> 00:19:30.850
<i>I won't let you...</i>

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:34.110
<i>hurt the Doctor.</i>

00:19:51.470 --> 00:19:52.690
What's this?

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:56.000
What's going... on...

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:00.490
Make...

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:04.080
Make sure...

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:08.030
you... get home...

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:13.560
Misha...

00:20:24.220 --> 00:20:25.110
No...

00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:28.920
No!

00:20:42.030 --> 00:20:44.320
What did I just...

00:20:58.340 --> 00:21:00.130
I-I didn't...

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:02.690
Th-That's... That's not me...

00:21:06.430 --> 00:21:07.550
Amiya.

00:21:08.980 --> 00:21:10.120
No way...

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:14.130
Skullshatterer...

00:21:14.130 --> 00:21:16.800
They got Skullshatterer?

00:21:16.800 --> 00:21:18.800
Impossible!

00:21:18.800 --> 00:21:21.140
Let's go! We'll bring him back!

00:21:30.280 --> 00:21:31.640
<i>Pull out for now.</i>

00:21:32.550 --> 00:21:36.820
But Inspector, this is our 
chance to wipe out Reunion!

00:21:36.820 --> 00:21:39.940
<i>With the way things are, 
we can't continue our search for Misha.</i>

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:42.670
<i>If we keep fighting, 
we'll just end up wasting lives.</i>

00:21:42.670 --> 00:21:43.570
But...

00:21:43.840 --> 00:21:45.320
<i>That's an order.</i>

00:21:46.220 --> 00:21:47.200
Understood.

00:21:56.480 --> 00:21:57.640
Why...

00:21:59.920 --> 00:22:01.390
Why?

00:22:03.130 --> 00:22:04.410
Amiya...
